sketch-orca
===========

sketch-orca is a command-line slicer: OrcaSlicer's slicing library (libslic3r) with a front end
that reads a job file and writes G-code, a project file and a result file, built without
OrcaSlicer's graphical interface. It is free software under the GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3 (LICENSE). Other programs, such as Sketch, run it as a separate program and talk to it
only through its command line and files (protocol/README.md).

